('Zaid', 'arabic', 'boy', 'abundance, growth', 'Name of the Prophet''s adopted son Zaid ibn Haritha, the only companion named in the Quran.', 'زايد', 'zah-EED', 66),
('Ismail', 'arabic', 'boy', 'God will hear', 'The Quranic prophet Ishmael, son of Abraham, builder of the Kaaba with his father.', 'إسماعيل', 'is-mah-EEL', 65),
