('Zakariya', 'arabic', 'boy', 'God remembers', 'The Quranic prophet Zechariah, guardian of Mary, remembered for devoted prayer.', 'زكريا', 'zah-kah-REE-yah', 50),
('Sami', 'arabic', 'boy', 'exalted, elevated, all-hearing', 'From the divine attribute al-Samee, "the All-Hearing". Dignified and gentle.', 'سامي', 'SAH-mee', 58),
